        <p>Tracking <strong><?php echo count($t1_t2_clubs); ?></strong> T1/T2 Clubs. Found <strong><?php echo count($duplicates); ?></strong> duplicate clusters and <strong><?php echo count($missing_data); ?></strong> incomplete profiles.</p>

        <?php if (!empty($duplicates)): ?>
            <h2 style="margin-top:30px; border-bottom:2px solid #2271b1; padding-bottom:10px; display:inline-block;">1. Merge Duplicates</h2>
            <p>Pick the correct profile for each player and click the button. We will automatically transfer all match history and delete the clones.</p>

            <?php 
            $group_id = 0;
            foreach ($duplicates as $name => $profiles): $group_id++; ?>
                <div class="fs-cluster" id="cluster-<?php echo $group_id; ?>">
                    <h3 class="fs-cluster-title">Group: <?php echo ucwords($name); ?> (<?php echo count($profiles); ?> Profiles)</h3>

